  - title: LEVEL 9 | Series-Parallel Circuit | Overview
    explanation: 'ILLUSTRATIVE / NOT LIVE VERIFIED. Fixed R1 = 220 Ohm is in series
      with two parallel return branches: fixed R2 = 330 Ohm and replaceable R3. Start
      R3 at unsuitable 220 Ohm; correct R3 is 470 Ohm. LCD is high-impedance across
      VOUT and Battery_negative, not a current return.'
    caption: PAGE 1/4 | R1 SERIES WITH (R2 PARALLEL R3) | 5 V
    parts:
    - id: battery
      kind: 0
