  - title: LEVEL 9 | Exact Seven Wiring Connections
    explanation: ILLUSTRATIVE / NOT LIVE VERIFIED. 1 SwitchOutput -> R1 Register_Input.
      2 R1 Register_Output -> R2 Register_Input. 3 R1 Register_Output -> R3 Register_Input.
      4 R2 Register_Output -> Battery_negative. 5 R3 Register_Output -> Battery_negative.
      6 LCD_Terminal_A -> R1 Register_Output (VOUT). 7 LCD_Terminal_B -> Battery_negative.
      Battery_positive -> switch input is assumed prewired. VOUT is a shared node;
      ensure connection capacity and actual SparkCircuitSystem wires.
    caption: PAGE 2/4 | SEVEN WIRES AFTER BATTERY+ TO SWITCH INPUT
