  - title: LEVEL 9 | Voltage & Current Measurements
    explanation: 'NOMINAL DESIGN VALUES / NOT LIVE READINGS. At 5 V, R1 220 Ohm and
      (R2 330 Ohm || R3 470 Ohm): parallel equivalent = 193.875 Ohm, total resistance
      = 413.875 Ohm; total / R1 current = 12.081 mA. VOUT / R2 / R3 voltage = 2.342
      V; R1 drop = 2.658 V. R2 current = 7.098 mA, R3 current = 4.983 mA. LCD AutoVoltageAndComponentCurrent
      displays A-B voltage and the current of whichever fixed component is assigned
      in SparkLCDMeterDisplay; it does not automatically report total current.'
