  - title: LEVEL 9 | Correct Circuit & Completion
    explanation: 'ILLUSTRATIVE / NOT LIVE VERIFIED. Replace shelf R3 220 Ohm with
      R3 470 Ohm. R1 220 and R2 330 stay fixed. Targets: R1 conducting; fixed R2
      voltage between 2.25 and 2.45 V; fixed R2 current between 6.7 and 7.5 mA; supply
      current between 11.8 and 12.4 mA. Confirm both R2 and R3 have their own direct
      electrical return to Battery_negative, valid source-current polarity, no shorts,
      and healthy installed resistors. Only the existing SparkLevelEvaluator awards
      4/4 and unlocks Level 10.'
    caption: PAGE 4/4 | R3 470 Ohm | 2.342 V | 12.081 mA | 4 TARGETS
